      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm putting together a nutrition plan for a client who wants to max out hypertrophy. can you give me a technical breakdown of how leucine specifically triggers the mTOR pathway and how staying in a caloric surplus impacts their nitrogen balance? thanks",
